@startuml 岗位归属校验核心算法流程图
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam activityDiamondFontSize 13
skinparam activityFontSize 13
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

start
:输入 companyUserId、jobId;
:查当前登录企业的档案;
:按 jobId 查岗位;
if (岗位存在?) then (否)
  :抛异常"岗位不存在";
  stop
else (是)
endif
:比对 job.companyId 与 company.id;
if (岗位属于当前企业?) then (否)
  :抛异常"岗位不属于当前企业，无权操作";
  stop
else (是)
endif
:校验通过，继续执行操作;
stop
@enduml